    "body": "Can confirm its still happening - reproducible with a default tokyo-night preset on pwsh, git bash, on Windows.\r\n\r\n```text\r\n❯ starship --version\r\nstarship 1.18.2\r\nbranch:master\r\ncommit_hash:\r\nbuild_time:2024-03-29 15:47:49 +00:00\r\nbuild_env:rustc 1.77.1 (7cf61ebde 2024-03-27),stable-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc\r\n```\r\n![image](https://github.com/starship/starship/assets/740416/903bda59-01da-42b6-8fac-4a8e71866f25)\r\n\r\nThough, I've only managed to get it to do this after running a command like `pnpm i`, anything that seems to invoke a newline.\r\n",
