    "body": "The issue is not Windows Terminal and PowerShell specific as the issue title states, tried if with Ghostty and Alacritty on MacOS with zsh:\r\n\r\n```\r\nstarship 1.21.1\r\nbranch:\r\ncommit_hash:\r\nbuild_time:1980-01-01 00:00:00 +00:00\r\nbuild_env:rustc 1.82.0 (f6e511eec 2024-10-15) (built from a source tarball)\r\n```\r\n<img width=\"668\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-01-08 at 11 15 44 PM\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/62d0c4b6-efee-4534-a11c-dcf5ece94010\" />\r\n\r\nBut wondering still if it's an issue with the terminal emulators themselves in this instance, resizing the pane fixes the issue in Ghostty:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"629\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-01-08 at 11 23 41 PM\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2f6c4174-2e8e-4b3c-ab45-c64b5b5b4d44\" />\r\n\r\nAfter a resize in Alacritty:\r\n<img width=\"825\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-01-08 at 11 28 56 PM\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5d4f49f1-8ece-405b-adbc-b103a6de4d48\" />\r\n\r\nHmm, note that I can't reproduce with Nushell thought, hope it helps.",
